From 7df30d016c5610a281a4ea67296dea6dff0645ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 21:09:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui: image overlay slot, scene annotations, and calibration
 callback for application labeling

PlaybackWorkspace gains renderImageOverlay (drawn inside each tile's zoom transform, in
source pixels), sceneAnnotations (points and segments in calibration world mm, drawn in the
3D viewport under the reference transform) and onCalibration (the bundle's loaded calibration).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
